{"speciesId":749,"names":{"fr":"Tiboudet","es":"Mudbray","en":"Mudbray","ja":"ドロバンコ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"La boue qui lui colle aux pattes lui sert de semelle antidérapante. Il peut ainsi courir à toute allure avec vigueur et assurance."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"El lodo que impregna sus patas le otorga una fuerte tracción, lo que le permite alcanzar altas velocidades al correr."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"The mud stuck to Mudbray’s hooves enhances its grip and its powerful running gait."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"足に まとわりついた 泥が グリップに なり 力強い 走りを 実現しているのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Un Pokémon très têtu, qui aime faire les choses à son rythme. Il passe ses journées à mâcher de la terre pour en faire de la boue et jouer avec."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Pokémon de naturaleza testaruda y amante de hacer las cosas a su propio ritmo. Se pasa el día comiendo arena y chapoteando en el lodo."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It has a stubborn, individualistic disposition. Eating dirt, making mud, and playing in the mire all form part of its daily routine."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"頑固で マイペースな 性格。 土を 食んで 泥を つくって 泥遊び するのが 日課。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il adore jouer dans la boue. S’il ne prend pas son bain de boue quotidien, il tombe dans un tel état de stress qu’il n’obéit plus à son Dresseur."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Le encanta chapotear en el lodo. Si no recibe su baño de lodo diario, se vuelve desobediente por el estrés."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It loves playing in the mud. If it isn’t showered with mud on a daily basis, it gets stressed out and stops listening to its Trainer."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"泥遊びが 大好き。 毎日 泥を 浴びないと ストレスで いうことを 聞かなくなってしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ce Pokémon costaud n’a aucun mal à porter des fardeaux pesant cinquante fois son poids."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Posee una fuerza asombrosa. Puede llevar sin dificultad cargas cuyo peso sea 50 veces superior al suyo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Possessing mighty power, Mudbray can be loaded with 50 times its own body weight and will be totally fine."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"かなりの 力持ち。 自分の 体重の ５０倍の 荷物を 乗せられても まるで 平気だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il est si fort qu’il peut aisément porter des charges allant jusqu’à 50 fois son poids. C’est un expert dans l’art d’utiliser la boue."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Puede llevar sin dificultad cargas cuyo peso sea 50 veces superior al suyo. Utiliza el lodo con suma destreza."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Loads weighing up to 50 times as much as its own body weight pose no issue for this Pokémon. It’s skilled at making use of mud."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"体重の ５０倍の 荷物を 軽々と 運ぶ 力持ち。 泥の 扱いに 長けている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il mâche de la terre pour créer une boue dont il s’enduit les jambes. Celle-ci lui permet alors d’arpenter même les routes accidentées."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Tras recubrir sus patas con el lodo que crea masticando tierra, puede recorrer los peores caminos sin temor a resbalar."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It eats dirt to create mud and smears this mud all over its feet, giving them the grip needed to walk on rough terrain without slipping."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"土を 食べて つくった 泥を 脚に 塗りつけると 悪路でも 滑らず 歩けるようになるのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":749,"moves":[{"name":"stomp","learns":[[17,"level-up",17],[18,"level-up",17],[20,"level-up",16],[25,"level-up",16]]},{"name":"double-kick","learns":[[17,"level-up",15],[18,"level-up",15],[20,"level-up",8],[25,"level-up",8]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[17,"level-up",43],[18,"level-up",43],[20,"level-up",40],[